 =?UTF-8?q?sses=20the=20pairing=20that=20arrives=20after=20it=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20two=20paths,=20measured?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

MEASURED DEFECT, found by running the row on the mixed two-capture sim
rather than reasoning about it. The row minted ZERO subjects there. It
was not an empty residue: eleven tiles carried failed attempts and SIX
of them are covered by two captures at the shared rung — (0,0,5),
(0,4,4), (0,4,5), (0,5,5), (0,6,3), (0,6,5). Every one was missed,
because `subjects_of` evaluated the pairing at the instant the failure
was folded, the second capture's evidence had not yet landed, and no
union-stage failure ever followed to re-arm it (the union stage attempted
exactly one tile all run — the other 34 union subjects certified through
a scan before their worker popped). That is precisely the birth-time
reasoning the standing ruling forbids: determine at runtime, not at
birth time.

THE FIX: the row's condition has two halves that arrive in either order,
so it gets two birth paths over one subject vocabulary. A failed attempt
mints the subject where the pairing already stands; a piece of evidence —
the union row's own birth, `tiles._union_subjects` reused whole — mints
it where a failure already stands. Neither path can be dropped, and
together they are complete.

The failure half is now a monotone derived index in the store,
`tile_attempt_failed`, folded from the attempt facts already being
folded: no digest, no epoch, no stamp, and a failure never un-happens,
which is exactly what makes asking it at birth safe on both paths. It
stays out of `eligible` on purpose — an ineligible pop burns the
worker's version, and a failure landing afterwards wakes nobody (attempt
folds emit no keys), so a fire-time residue gate would have opened a
starvation path for a scan job that was in flight when the pool worker
popped. `eligible`/`retire` therefore test certification alone, which is
the only condition that is ever permanent.

MEASURED AFTER: the mixed sim mints exactly those six subjects and fires
ZERO times — all six certify through the ordinary rows before a
110-priced worker pops. Every other row is unmoved job for job
(calibrate 136, ctx 28, place 257, survey 2, tiles.retry 20,
tiles.scan 139, tiles.union 3), 49/49 certified, payload byte-exact.
Born for the residue, charged nothing when there is none. Both facts are
now pinned in test_h3_multires.py, the census asserted equal to
`failed & union_tiles` rather than to a bare list.

`_failed_tiles` joins the store-cell inventory and the fold write map, so
the "assembly writes nothing to the store" snapshot really covers it.
SCHEDULE.md's generated block re-rendered (the born-by column grew).

test_h3_multires.py 19 passed (slow lane); fast lane 1424 passed.

